    {
      "segment": 8,
      "he": "מָשִׁיחַ אָז לֹא יִהְיֶה שֶּׁקֶר, וּבִשְׁבִיל זֶה לֹא יִהְיֶה יֵצֶר הָרָע בָּעוֹלָם.",
      "en": "8. From the breath (of the mouth) of a liar, the evil inclination is created, and when the Messiah comes, (then) there will be no falsehood, and consequently, there will be no evil inclination in the world.",
